OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA murky
OL,6,Fevening and night for many, with the
OL,7,Fnorth cloudier and damp, while
OL,8,Fsouthern parts may develop some areas
OL,9,Fof mist and fog. Chilly by dawn, with
OL,10,Fa chance of pockets of grass frost in
OL,11,Fprone spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FCloudy in the north, with
OL,14,Fintermittent light rain dying away.
OL,15,FDrier in southern parts as areas of
OL,16,Ffog gradually lift. Eventual sunny
OL,17,Fspells possible generally. Light winds
OL,18,Fand near-average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
